              "text": "Depending on whether you are ordering in the **United Kingdom** or the **United States**, the best active Domino's voucher and promo codes vary.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 Domino's UK Voucher Codes & National Deals\nDomino's UK is known for \"hidden\" codes that work nationwide, as well as automatic national promotions.\n\n#### Top Active UK Codes\n*   **`DINEON50`**: Get **50% off your entire order** when you spend \u00a340 or more. *(This is a highly reliable \"secret\" code that works on pizzas, sides, and desserts).*\n*   **`UNIBIG50`**: Get **50% off your order** for students or general users (requires a \u00a340 minimum spend).\n*   **`1030OFFO`**: Get **10% off orders of \u00a330+**.\n\n#### UK National Deals (No Code Needed)\n*   **Two for Tuesday**: Buy one pizza, get one free on Tuesdays. \n*   **Price Slice**: Pick up select pizzas starting from **\u00a310**.\n*   **50% Off Collection**: Most local stores automatically offer up to 50% off when you choose to collect your pizza instead of getting it delivered.\n*   **Blue Light Card / Defence Discount**: If you work for the NHS, emergency services, or armed forces, you can get up to 50% off collection orders by showing your ID.\n\n*Tip: Because many UK franchises are individually owned, always check the **Deals** section on the official website or app after entering your postcode to find local codes (like \u00a310 off \u00a330) unique to your nearest store.*\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 Domino's US Promo Codes & Deals\nIf you are ordering in the United States, there are several national coupon codes and limited-time events running:\n\n#### Active US National Deals\n*   **50% Off All Menu-Priced Pizzas**: To celebrate National Dairy Month, Domino's is offering **50% off all menu-priced pizzas**. \n    *   *Note: This deal runs from June 1 through **June 7, 2026** (today is the final day!). You can redeem it directly on the app or website without a manual code.*\n*   **Mix & Match Deal ($6.99 each)**: Order any two or more medium 2-topping pizzas, breads, pastas, sandwiches, or salads for $6.99 each. Use promo code **`9193`** if it is not automatically applied at checkout.\n*   **Weeklong Carryout Special ($7.99 each)**: Get a Large 1-topping pizza, 8-piece wings, or 8-piece boneless chicken for **$7.99**. *(Carryout only, excludes XL and specialty pizzas).*\n*   **Perfect Combo Deal ($19.99)**: Get 2 medium 1-topping pizzas, 16-piece Parmesan Bread Bites, 16-piece Garlic Bread Bites, and a 2-liter bottle of Coke. \n*   **Handmade Pan Pizza ($8.99 each)**: Get a medium 2-topping Handmade Pan Pizza for $8.99 using code **`9204`**.\n*   **Free Slice Sauce**: Purchase a Handmade Pan or Parmesan Stuffed Crust pizza online or in-app to receive a free Slice Sauce dip cup (deal active through **June 14, 2026**).\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca1 Tips for Maximizing Your Savings\n1.  **Check the \"Deals\" Tab First**: Rather than searching for external codes, Domino's often lists their best local carryout and delivery bundles directly under the \"Deals\" or \"Coupons\" tab of their app.\n2.  **Join Domino's Rewards**: Signing up for the free loyalty program allows you to earn points on every order. You can easily redeem these points for free pizzas, garlic bread, or lava cakes. \n3.  **Opt for Carryout**: You will almost always save on delivery fees, driver tips, and unlock cheaper base menu prices by picking up your pizza yourself.",
